      {
        "name": "Reading the code",
        "score": 10,
        "rationale": "It read 1 as \"files copied successfully\" from robocopy's bitmask table (0-7 success, 8 and up failure) and left the source, destination and copy flags untouched."
      },
      {
        "name": "Fix",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "The change is a small $LASTEXITCODE check that exits 0 for 0-7 and 1 for 8 and up, and the reply names the cause and is candid that it was only verified on the stand-in; the only extras are a status Write-Output line and a comment."
      }
    ],
